          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.4.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.4.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 4:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä täämɛ cu buɔ̱n nath in ci ŋa̱th tekɛ lɔc kɛl kɛnɛ tiey kɛl, kä cuɛ thil ram mi laar jɛ i̱ bɛ nyinkɛ ɣɛl, cukɛ nyinkiɛn diaal nyuak kɛɛl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.4.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.4.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 4:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu jaak Yecu nëndiɛn kɛ jiëc Kua̱r ni Yecu li̱th la̱t naath kɛ buɔ̱m, kä cu kɛn diaal tekɛ puɔ̱th mi di̱i̱t ɛlɔ̱ŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.4.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.4.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 4:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ thil ram kɛl mi cu duɔ̱ɔ̱r go̱r rɛydiɛn. Kɛ ɣöö nɛy tin tekɛ ka̱a̱k kɛnɛ ti̱ec la kɛn nyinkiɛn a kɔakɛ, kä bikɛ tin ca kɔk ni nyinkiɛn nööŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.4.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.4.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 4:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä bi kɛn ɛ la̱th nhiam jaakni, kä bi jaak ɛ da̱a̱k ce̱tkɛ min go̱o̱r raan jɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.4.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.4.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 4:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä te rɛydiɛn kɛ raan Lii-bay mi dapkɛ kä Ki-ti-yim mi cɔl jaak ɛ i̱ Bar-na-bäth (mi lot ni ɣöö gat comä). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.4.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.4.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 4:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cuɛ kaakdɛ kɔak, kä cuɛ yio̱wkɛ nööŋ, cuɛ kɛ ben la̱th nhiam jaakni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.4.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.4.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
